eviews, but it doesn't say all. So, if Subway doesn't get negative reviews, it's possible that it doesn't have take-out, but the fact that some without take-out do get negative reviews doesn't necessarily affect Subway's situation. However, the key is that Subway either has a high rating or is popular, both of which lead to it being recommended and thus not getting negative reviews. Therefore, Subway must have take-out service because if it didn't, it would be in the category that gets negative reviews, but it doesn't. So, the statement that Subway does not provide take-out service is false.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Subway does not provide take-out service\" is false.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
