igh means Tom can't rent the apartment, but that doesn't affect whether he's allowed to live with Fluffy. The context doesn't say anything about whether having a pet is allowed in all managed buildings or if there are other conditions.\n\nTherefore, the statement is uncertain because the context doesn't provide enough information about whether having a cat in the Olive Garden is allowed. It only talks about the deposit and the rent, not about the pet itself.\n</think>\n\nThe statement is uncertain because the context does not provide information about whether Tom is allowed to live with Fluffy in the Olive Garden, only about the deposit and rent conditions.\n\nAnswer: C) Uncertain",
