y. So, the statement is true.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. From statement 5, we concluded that dried Thai chilies must be spicy because if they were a bakery, they couldn't be spicy, leading to a contradiction. So, they are spicy. Since no bakery is spicy, they can't be a bakery. Also, since all products of Baked by Melissa are cupcakes (which are bakeries), if they were a product of Baked by Melissa, they'd be a bakery, which they aren't. So, yes, they are neither.\n\nSo, the statement is true. Therefore, the answer should be A) True.\n</think>\n\nThe statement is true because dried Thai chilies are spicy (as they can't be a bakery) and thus not a product of Baked by Melissa, nor a bakery themselves.\n\nA) True",
