ation to confirm either way.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Harry is a CEO\" is uncertain because the premises only establish that all CEOs are gentlemen, but they don't confirm that all gentlemen are CEOs. Harry being a gentleman doesn't necessarily make him a CEO.\n\nAnswer: C) Uncertain",
