essarily mean it's a Romance language. It could be a different language within the same broader family, but the context doesn't confirm that. Therefore, the statement is uncertain because the context doesn't explicitly say German is a Romance language, even though it's related to one.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"German is a Romance language\" is uncertain because the context doesn't explicitly confirm German's classification as a Romance language, despite its relation to Spanish.\n\nAnswer: C) Uncertain",
